# 登录接口会通过响应脚本自动保存 userToken、adminToken 和 opsToken。
# 后端每次重启后，都需要重新执行第2、3、4步生成新令牌。
# 第8步创建订单成功后会自动保存 orderId。

### 1. 健康检查：确认后端已经启动
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/system/health

### 2. 普通用户模拟登录：成功后自动保存 userToken
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/auth/mock-login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "模块开发人员",
  "accountType": "USER"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("userToken", response.body.data.accessToken);
%}

### 3. 管理员模拟登录：成功后自动保存 adminToken
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/auth/mock-login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "资源管理员",
  "accountType": "ADMIN"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.data.accessToken);
%}

### 4. 运维人员模拟登录：成功后自动保存 opsToken
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/auth/mock-login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "审计运维",
  "accountType": "OPS"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("opsToken", response.body.data.accessToken);
%}

### 5. 查询已上架资源列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/resources?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 6. 查询资源详情：将5替换为资源列表中的真实 resourceId
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/resources/5
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 7. 查询SKU库存：将5替换为资源详情中的真实 skuId
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/resource-skus/5/availability?date=2026-07-30&timeSlot=
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 8. 创建订单：每次创建新订单都必须使用新的 Idempotency-Key
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Idempotency-Key: shared-order-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "skuId": 5,
      "quantity": 1,
      "serviceDate": "2026-07-30",
      "timeSlot": "",
      "businessData": {
        "visitors": [
          {
            "name": "张三",
            "mobile": "13800138000",
            "idType": "ID_CARD",
            "idNo": "110101199001011234"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "remark": "模块联调订单"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("orderId", response.body.data.id);
%}

### 9. 查询我的订单列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/orders?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 10. 查询订单详情：使用第8步自动保存的 orderId
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 11. 模拟支付：只允许支付未过期的待支付订单
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/orders/{{orderId}}/mock-pay
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Idempotency-Key: shared-payment-001

### 12. 查询已支付订单的电子票
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/orders/{{orderId}}/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 13. 查询订单完整时间线：包含创建、支付、退款和核销事件
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/orders/{{orderId}}/timeline
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 14. 模拟退款：仅用于已支付且电子票尚未核销的订单
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/orders/{{orderId}}/mock-refund
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Idempotency-Key: shared-refund-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "模块联调退款"
}

### 15. 管理员查询全部订单
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/orders?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 16. 管理员查询指定订单详情
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 17. 管理员手动扫描超时未支付订单：系统每分钟也会自动扫描
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/orders/expire-overdue
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 18. 管理员下架资源：测试完成后务必执行第19步恢复上架
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/resources/5/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "INACTIVE"
}

### 19. 管理员恢复资源上架
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/resources/5/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### 20. 管理员减少一份库存：库存记录ID不是skuId，请使用数据库中的真实 inventoryId
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/inventories/5/adjust
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Idempotency-Key: shared-inventory-adjust-down-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "delta": -1,
  "remark": "联调测试减少库存"
}

### 21. 管理员恢复一份库存：必须使用新的 Idempotency-Key
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/inventories/5/adjust
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Idempotency-Key: shared-inventory-adjust-up-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "delta": 1,
  "remark": "联调测试恢复库存"
}

### 22. 管理员核销电子票：将核销码替换为第12步返回的 data[0].code
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/verifications/consume
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "请粘贴电子票核销码"
}

### 23. 运维人员查询审计日志
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/ops/audit-logs?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{opsToken}}

### 24. 查询景区订单的脱敏游客信息：使用第8步自动保存的 orderId
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/scenic/orders/{{orderId}}/visitors
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
